Package: likelyprofiler
Title: Likelihood profiles for nonlinear objective functions.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Baptiste", "Turpin", , "baptiste.turpin@bsse.ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simple package for likelihood profiles from general objective functions. Focus on potentially compute-intensive objective functions, with control over the number of evaluations and optimization tools.
